{"3589820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Don't Pop The Balloon", "steam_appid": 3589820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DON'T POP THE BALLOON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Pop the Balloon is a challenging co-op adventure that ties you and your friend to a single balloon with a delicate string. Your goal is clear: move in perfect harmony and reach the end of the level without popping the balloon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISTANCE = CONTROL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the distance between you to control the balloon:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get closer: The balloon rises</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move apart: The balloon lowers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too far apart: The string stretches and the balloon pops!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must maintain this balance to survive tight spaces and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589820/extras/b2d56916b20b7b083a51eaa3f1fd34c5.poster.avif?t=1787135049\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589820/extras/b2d56916b20b7b083a51eaa3f1fd34c5.webm?t=1787135049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589820/extras/b2d56916b20b7b083a51eaa3f1fd34c5.mp4?t=1787135049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAPS AND OBSTACLES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balloon-Targeted Traps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-Targeted Traps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving Obstacles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight Spaces</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake sends you back to the last checkpoint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589820/extras/cefd150fd11918b33985276cc207952e.poster.avif?t=1787135049\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589820/extras/cefd150fd11918b33985276cc207952e.webm?t=1787135049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589820/extras/cefd150fd11918b33985276cc207952e.mp4?t=1787135049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Push Mechanic</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support your friend through tough sections.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it to destroy enemies at certain points.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or test your friend's patience by pushing them into traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589820/extras/ac1dcc0c6959e45c3f2c9f404757ad4e.poster.avif?t=1787135049\" width=1170 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589820/extras/ac1dcc0c6959e45c3f2c9f404757ad4e.webm?t=1787135049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589820/extras/ac1dcc0c6959e45c3f2c9f404757ad4e.mp4?t=1787135049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Players Required: Cannot be played solo — syncing with your partner is a must.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online &amp; Local Co-op: Play side by side or remotely.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of checkpoints varies based on the difficulty you choose:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy: All checkpoints active.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medium: Checkpoint after every 2 traps.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard: Checkpoint after every 3 traps.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impossible: NO checkpoints! (Exclusively for brave players seeking a real challenge.)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take a deep breath and trust your partner. Let's see if you can complete the course, or if you'll end up disappointed along with your balloon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DON'T POP THE BALLOON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't Pop the Balloon is a challenging co-op adventure that ties you and your friend to a single balloon with a delicate string. Your goal is clear: move in perfect harmony and reach the end of the level without popping the balloon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISTANCE = CONTROL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the distance between you to control the balloon:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get closer: The balloon rises</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move apart: The balloon lowers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too far apart: The string stretches and the balloon pops!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must maintain this balance to survive tight spaces and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589820/extras/b2d56916b20b7b083a51eaa3f1fd34c5.poster.avif?t=1787135049\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589820/extras/b2d56916b20b7b083a51eaa3f1fd34c5.webm?t=1787135049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589820/extras/b2d56916b20b7b083a51eaa3f1fd34c5.mp4?t=1787135049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAPS AND OBSTACLES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balloon-Targeted Traps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-Targeted Traps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving Obstacles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight Spaces</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake sends you back to the last checkpoint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589820/extras/cefd150fd11918b33985276cc207952e.poster.avif?t=1787135049\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589820/extras/cefd150fd11918b33985276cc207952e.webm?t=1787135049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589820/extras/cefd150fd11918b33985276cc207952e.mp4?t=1787135049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Push Mechanic</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support your friend through tough sections.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it to destroy enemies at certain points.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or test your friend's patience by pushing them into traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"